cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PyImageLabeling in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: PyImageLabeling
abstract: >-
  Desktop image annotation tool for creating segmentation masks used to
  train computer vision models. It combines pixel-level and geometric
  labeling tools with AI assistance: Segment Anything (SAM, MedSAM),
  text-to-mask with Grounding DINO, one-shot propagation with DINOv2,
  model training on the annotations and active learning. It runs offline,
  so images never leave the user's computer.
